    resource 0x7f130088 string/agreement_human_readable_content PUBLIC
      () "Movness 是你的随身行动助手。说出目标后，它会根据当前配置使用手机工具，也可以把工作交给已连接的电脑；聊天回复不等于任务已经完成。

      先接入你自己的模型，再按需要开启执行权限。连接电脑时，在工作台打开「电脑连接」，识别电脑提供的配对二维码，在电脑确认后选择会话。连接成功不代表所有工具都已授权。

      任务记录在「任务」里查看；电脑返回的文件要实际取回后，才会出现在「电脑连接」的成果列表。取回过的旧版文件会保留。手机上的停止按钮只停止当前手机回合，电脑任务需要单独取消。

      聊天和配置保存在应用数据中。使用云模型或联网工具时，消息、选中的文件、工具结果和任务所需的情境信息可能发送到你配置的服务端；本地模型在设备内推理。位置、日程等数据取决于你启用的工具和系统授权，并非默认持续收集。

      文件、终端和自动化工具可以改变设备内容。你决定目标与权限；对外发送、删除和发布等操作应在你的授权范围内。模型说「完成」时，仍应能找到实际结果。

      这是开发预览版，不保证全天候后台运行。你可以在设置中撤销权限、删除记录或导出备份；系统卸载会清除应用私有数据，已导出的文件及第三方服务中的副本需要另行管理。反馈请联系向你提供此版本的 Movness 项目维护者。"
      (id) "Movness is your personal action assistant. State a goal and it can use configured phone tools or work with a paired computer. A chat response is not proof that a task finished.

      Connect your own model and enable the execution permissions you need. In Workbench, open Computer connection, scan the pairing QR code provided by your computer, approve on the computer, and select a session. Pairing does not grant every tool permission.

      Open Tasks for task history. Computer files appear in Computer connection results only after they have actually been retrieved; older retrieved versions remain available. Stop on the phone stops the phone turn; computer work must be cancelled separately.

      Chats and settings are stored in app data. Cloud models and network tools may receive messages, selected files, tool output and relevant context at the endpoints you configure. Local models run on the device. Access to location or calendar depends on enabled tools and Android permissions, rather than continuous collection by default.

      File, terminal and automation tools can change device contents. You control goals and permissions. Sending, deleting and publishing must stay within your authorization. A completed task should have an inspectable result.

      This is a development preview with no promise of continuous background operation. Revoke permissions, delete history or export backups in settings. Uninstalling clears private app data; exported files and copies at third-party services need separate management. Contact the Movness maintainer who supplied this preview for feedback."
