    resource 0x7f13023f string/avatar_config_import_methods PUBLIC
      () "直接文件导入支持 .glb/.gltf/.mp4/.fbx；DragonBones、WebP、MP4、MMD、多文件 glTF，或带外置贴图/资源的 FBX 请导入 .zip。"
      (id) "Impor file langsung mendukung .glb/.gltf/.mp4/.fbx; DragonBones, WebP, MP4, MMD, glTF multi-file, atau FBX dengan tekstur/aset eksternal harap impor sebagai .zip."
      (en) "Direct file import supports .glb/.gltf/.mp4/.fbx; use .zip for DragonBones, WebP, MP4, MMD, multi-file glTF, or FBX packages with external textures/resources."
      (ko) "직접 파일 가져오기는 .glb/.gltf/.mp4/.fbx를 지원합니다. 외부 텍스처/리소스가 포함된 DragonBones, WebP, MP4, MMD, 다중 파일 glTF 또는 FBX 패키지의 경우 .zip을 사용하세요."
      (ro) "Suport pentru importul direct al fișierelor .glb/.gltf/.mp4/.fbx;DragonBones,WebP,MP4,MMD, mai multe fișiere glTF, sau cu texturi externe/Resursele FBX Vă rugăm să importați .zip."
      (es) "Importación directa de archivos soporta .glb/.gltf/.mp4/.fbx; DragonBones, WebP, MP4, MMD, glTF de múltiples archivos, o FBX con texturas/recursos externos, importe .zip."
      (ms) "Import fail langsung menyokong .glb/.gltf/.mp4/.fbx; DragonBones, WebP, MP4, MMD, glTF berbilang fail, atau FBX dengan tekstur/sumber luaran, sila import .zip."
      (pt-rBR) "A importação direta de arquivos suporta .glb/.gltf/.mp4/.fbx; DragonBones, WebP, MP4, MMD, glTF de vários arquivos ou FBX com texturas/recursos externos, importe .zip."
    resource 0x7f130240 string/avatar_config_supported_formats PUBLIC
      () "支持：DragonBones（.json + _tex.json + _tex.png）、WebP（.webp）、MP4（.mp4）、MMD（.pmx/.pmd + 可选 .vmd）、glTF（.glb/.gltf）、FBX（.fbx）。"
      (id) "Didukung: DragonBones (.json + _tex.json + _tex.png), WebP (.webp), MP4 (.mp4), MMD (.pmx/.pmd + opsional .vmd), glTF (.glb/.gltf), FBX (.fbx)."
      (en) "Supported: DragonBones (.json + _tex.json + _tex.png), WebP (.webp), MP4 (.mp4), MMD (.pmx/.pmd + optional .vmd), glTF (.glb/.gltf), FBX (.fbx)."
      (ko) "지원됨: DragonBones(.json + _tex.json + _tex.png), WebP(.webp), MP4(.mp4), MMD(.pmx/.pmd + 선택적 .vmd), glTF(.glb/.gltf), FBX(.fbx)."
      (ro) "Suport:DragonBones(.json + _tex.json + _tex.png),WebP(.webp),MP4(.mp4),MMD(.pmx/.pmd + Opțional .vmd),glTF(.glb/.gltf),FBX(.fbx)."
      (es) "Soporta: DragonBones (.json + _tex.json + _tex.png), WebP (.webp), MP4 (.mp4), MMD (.pmx/.pmd + .vmd opcional), glTF (.glb/.gltf), FBX (.fbx)."
      (ms) "Disokong: DragonBones (.json + _tex.json + _tex.png), WebP (.webp), MP4 (.mp4), MMD (.pmx/.pmd + pilihan .vmd), glTF (.glb/.gltf), FBX (.fbx)."
      (pt-rBR) "Suporte: DragonBones (.json + _tex.json + _tex.png), WebP (.webp), MP4 (.mp4), MMD (.pmx/.pmd + .vmd opcional), glTF (.glb/.gltf), FBX (.fbx)."
