    resource 0x7f1308fa string/external_http_chat_intent_overview PUBLIC
      () "HTTP 与 Intent 参数语义一致，仅入口不同。

      请求 Action：%1$s
      默认回传 Action：%2$s

      常用 extras：message、request_id、group、create_new_chat、chat_id、create_if_none、show_floating、return_tool_status、initial_mode、auto_exit_after_ms、stop_after、reply_action、reply_package

      处理完成后会通过广播回传 success、chat_id、ai_response、error；如果只希望回传给指定 App，请设置 reply_package。"
      (id) "HTTP dan Intent memiliki semantik parameter yang sama, hanya pintu masuknya yang berbeda.

      Aksi Permintaan: %1$s
      Aksi Pengembalian Default: %2$s

      Ekstra yang umum digunakan: message, request_id, group, create_new_chat, chat_id, create_if_none, show_floating, return_tool_status, initial_mode, auto_exit_after_ms, stop_after, reply_action, reply_package

      Setelah pemrosesan selesai, akan dikembalikan melalui broadcast: success, chat_id, ai_response, error; jika hanya ingin dikembalikan ke aplikasi tertentu, atur reply_package."
      (en) "HTTP and Intent share the same parameter semantics. Only the entry method is different.

      Request action: %1$s
      Default result action: %2$s

      Common extras: message, request_id, group, create_new_chat, chat_id, create_if_none, show_floating, return_tool_status, initial_mode, auto_exit_after_ms, stop_after, reply_action, reply_package

      After completion, Movness returns success, chat_id, ai_response, and error by broadcast. If the result should only be delivered to one app, set reply_package."
      (ko) "HTTP와 Intent는 동일한 매개변수 의미를 공유합니다. 입력 방법만 다릅니다. 요청 Action: %1$s 기본 결과 Action: %2$s 공통 extras: message, request_id, group, create_new_chat, chat_id, create_if_none, show_floating, return_tool_status, initial_mode, auto_exit_after_ms, stop_after, reply_action, reply_package 완료 후 Movness는 success, chat_id, ai_response, error를 브로드캐스트로 반환합니다. 결과를 하나의 앱에만 전달해야 한다면 reply_package를 설정하세요."
      (ro) "HTTP și Intent Semantica parametrilor este identică, diferă doar punctul de intrare.

      Solicitare Action:%1$s
      Retrimitere implicită Action:%2$s

      Frecvent utilizate extras:message,request_id,group,create_new_chat,chat_id,create_if_none,show_floating,return_tool_status,initial_mode,auto_exit_after_ms,stop_after,reply_action,reply_package

      După finalizarea procesării, datele vor fi transmise înapoi prin difuzare success,chat_id,ai_response,error; dacă doriți să returnați doar către destinația specificată App, vă rugăm să configurați reply_package."
      (es) "Los parámetros de HTTP e Intent son semánticamente equivalentes, solo cambia la entrada.

      Action de solicitud: %1$s
      Action de retorno predeterminada: %2$s

      Extras comunes: message, request_id, group, create_new_chat, chat_id, create_if_none, show_floating, return_tool_status, initial_mode, auto_exit_after_ms, stop_after, reply_action, reply_package

      Una vez procesado, se retransmitirá mediante broadcast success, chat_id, ai_response, error; si solo desea que se devuelva a una aplicación específica, configure reply_package."
      (ms) "HTTP dan Intent mempunyai semantik parameter yang sama, hanya kemasukan yang berbeza.

      Tindakan Permintaan: %1$s
      Tindakan Pemulangan Lalai: %2$s

      Extras biasa: message, request_id, group, create_new_chat, chat_id, create_if_none, show_floating, return_tool_status, initial_mode, auto_exit_after_ms, stop_after, reply_action, reply_package

      Selepas pemprosesan selesai, ia akan dipulangkan melalui siaran: success, chat_id, ai_response, error; jika anda hanya mahu memulangkan kepada App tertentu, tetapkan reply_package."
      (pt-rBR) "A semântica dos parâmetros HTTP e Intent é consistente, apenas a entrada é diferente. 

      Ação de solicitação: %1$s
      Ação de retorno padrão: %2$s

      Extras comumente usados: mensagem, request_id, grupo, create_new_chat, chat_id, create_if_none, show_floating, return_tool_status, inicial_mode, auto_exit_after_ms, stop_after, resposta_ação, resposta_package

      Depois que o processamento for concluído, sucesso, chat_id, ai_response, erro será retornado através de broadcast; se você deseja apenas retornar ao aplicativo especificado, defina respond_package."
