    resource 0x7f130b83 string/import_structure_guide_content PUBLIC
      () "这是“导入包”的目录结构（ZIP 或选中文件内部），不是应用内部存储。

      DragonBones（.zip）
       my_dragonbones.zip
       any_folder_name/
       hero_ske.json
       hero_tex.json
       hero_tex.png
       要求：ske/tex json/png 文件名前缀一致。

      WebP（.zip）
       my_webp.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.webp
       talking.webp
       happy.webp
       要求：至少包含一个 .webp 文件。

      MP4
       方式 A（直接文件）:
       avatar.mp4
       方式 B（.zip）:
       my_mp4.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.mp4
       talking.mp4
       happy.mp4
       要求：至少包含一个 .mp4 文件。

      MMD（.zip）
       my_mmd.zip
       any_folder_name/
       character.pmx（或 .pmd）
       motions/idle.vmd（可选）
       textures/...
       要求：保持 PMX/PMD 引用的相对路径不变。

      glTF
       方式 A（直接文件）:
       avatar.glb
       方式 B（多文件 glTF 使用 .zip）:
       my_gltf.zip
       any_folder_name/
       avatar.gltf
       avatar.bin
       textures/...
       要求：保持 .gltf 引用的相对路径不变。

      FBX
       方式 A（直接文件，仅限自包含资源）:
       avatar.fbx
       方式 B（外置贴图/资源请使用 .zip）:
       my_fbx.zip
       any_folder_name/
       avatar.fbx
       textures/...
       要求：直接上传 .fbx 仅支持内嵌资源；若模型引用外置贴图或其他资源，请保持相对路径并放进 ZIP。"
      (id) "Ini adalah struktur direktori paket impor (ZIP atau di dalam file yang dipilih), bukan penyimpanan internal aplikasi.

      DragonBones (.zip)
       my_dragonbones.zip
       any_folder_name/
       hero_ske.json
       hero_tex.json
       hero_tex.png
       Persyaratan: awalan nama file ske/tex json/png harus sama.

      WebP (.zip)
       my_webp.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.webp
       talking.webp
       happy.webp
       Persyaratan: setidaknya berisi satu file .webp.

      MP4
       Metode A (file langsung):
       avatar.mp4
       Metode B (.zip):
       my_mp4.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.mp4
       talking.mp4
       happy.mp4
       Persyaratan: setidaknya berisi satu file .mp4.

      MMD (.zip)
       my_mmd.zip
       any_folder_name/
       character.pmx (atau .pmd)
       motions/idle.vmd (opsional)
       textures/...
       Persyaratan: pertahankan jalur relatif yang dirujuk oleh PMX/PMD.

      glTF
       Metode A (file langsung):
       avatar.glb
       Metode B (glTF multi-file gunakan .zip):
       my_gltf.zip
       any_folder_name/
       avatar.gltf
       avatar.bin
       textures/...
       Persyaratan: pertahankan jalur relatif yang dirujuk oleh .gltf.

      FBX
       Metode A (file langsung, hanya untuk aset yang mandiri):
       avatar.fbx
       Metode B (untuk tekstur/aset eksternal gunakan .zip):
       my_fbx.zip
       any_folder_name/
       avatar.fbx
       textures/...
       Persyaratan: unggah langsung .fbx hanya mendukung aset tertanam; jika model merujuk tekstur eksternal atau aset lain, pertahankan jalur relatif dan masukkan ke ZIP."
      (en) "This is the IMPORT PACKAGE layout (files inside your ZIP / picked file), not app internal storage.

      DragonBones (.zip)
       my_dragonbones.zip
       any_folder_name/
       hero_ske.json
       hero_tex.json
       hero_tex.png
       Requirement: ske/tex json/png files must share the same filename prefix.

      WebP (.zip)
       my_webp.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.webp
       talking.webp
       happy.webp
       Requirement: include at least one .webp file.

      MP4
       Method A (direct file):
       avatar.mp4
       Method B (.zip):
       my_mp4.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.mp4
       talking.mp4
       happy.mp4
       Requirement: include at least one .mp4 file.

      MMD (.zip)
       my_mmd.zip
       any_folder_name/
       character.pmx (or .pmd)
       motions/idle.vmd (optional)
       textures/...
       Requirement: keep relative paths referenced by PMX/PMD unchanged.

      glTF
       Method A (direct file):
       avatar.glb
       Method B (.zip for multi-file glTF):
       my_gltf.zip
       any_folder_name/
       avatar.gltf
       avatar.bin
       textures/...
       Requirement: keep relative paths referenced by .gltf unchanged.

      FBX
       Method A (direct file, self-contained assets only):
       avatar.fbx
       Method B (use .zip for external textures/resources):
       my_fbx.zip
       any_folder_name/
       avatar.fbx
       textures/...
       Requirement: direct .fbx upload only supports embedded resources; if the model references external textures or other assets, keep the relative paths and package everything in ZIP."
      (ko) "이 내용은 앱 내부 저장소가 아니라 가져오기 패키지의 구조입니다(ZIP 안의 파일 또는 선택한 파일 기준).

      DragonBones(.zip)
       my_dragonbones.zip
       any_folder_name/
       hero_ske.json
       hero_tex.json
       hero_tex.png
       요구 사항: ske/tex json/png 파일은 같은 파일명 접두사를 사용해야 합니다.

      WebP(.zip)
       my_webp.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.webp
       talking.webp
       happy.webp
       요구 사항: .webp 파일을 하나 이상 포함해야 합니다.

      MP4
       방식 A(직접 파일):
       avatar.mp4
       방식 B(.zip):
       my_mp4.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.mp4
       talking.mp4
       happy.mp4
       요구 사항: .mp4 파일을 하나 이상 포함해야 합니다.

      MMD(.zip)
       my_mmd.zip
       any_folder_name/
       character.pmx(또는 .pmd)
       motions/idle.vmd(선택 사항)
       textures/...
       요구 사항: PMX/PMD가 참조하는 상대 경로를 변경하지 않아야 합니다.

      glTF
       방식 A(직접 파일):
       avatar.glb
       방식 B(여러 파일로 된 glTF는 .zip 사용):
       my_gltf.zip
       any_folder_name/
       avatar.gltf
       avatar.bin
       textures/...
       요구 사항: .gltf가 참조하는 상대 경로를 변경하지 않아야 합니다.

      FBX
       방식 A(직접 파일, 자체 포함 리소스만):
       avatar.fbx
       방식 B(외부 텍스처/리소스는 .zip 사용):
       my_fbx.zip
       any_folder_name/
       avatar.fbx
       textures/...
       요구 사항: .fbx 직접 업로드는 내장 리소스만 지원합니다. 모델이 외부 텍스처나 다른 리소스를 참조하는 경우 상대 경로를 유지한 채 모두 ZIP으로 묶어 주세요."
      (ro) "Aceasta este structura de directoare a „pachetului de import” (ZIP sau în interiorul fișierului selectat), nu în memoria internă a aplicației.

      DragonBones(.zip)
       my_dragonbones.zip
       any_folder_name/
       hero_ske.json
       hero_tex.json
       hero_tex.png
       Cerințe:ske/tex json/png Prefixele numelor fișierelor sunt identice.

      WebP(.zip)
       my_webp.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.webp
       talking.webp
       happy.webp
       Cerințe: să conțină cel puțin unul .webp Fișier.

      MP4
       Modalitate A(fișier direct):
       avatar.mp4
       Modalitate B(.zip):
       my_mp4.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.mp4
       talking.mp4
       happy.mp4
       Cerințe: să conțină cel puțin unul .mp4 Fișier.

      MMD(.zip)
       my_mmd.zip
       any_folder_name/
       character.pmx(sau .pmd)
       motions/idle.vmd(opțional)
       textures/...
       Cerință: menținerea PMX/PMD Căile relative citate rămân neschimbate.

      glTF
       Modalitate A(fișier direct):
       avatar.glb
       Modalitate B(Mai multe fișiere glTF Utilizare .zip):
       my_gltf.zip
       any_folder_name/
       avatar.gltf
       avatar.bin
       textures/...
       Cerință: menținerea .gltf Căile relative citate rămân neschimbate.

      FBX
       Modalitate A(Fișiere directe, numai resurse autonome):
       avatar.fbx
       Modalitate B(Textură externă/Vă rugăm să utilizați resursele .zip):
       my_fbx.zip
       any_folder_name/
       avatar.fbx
       textures/...
       Cerințe: încărcare directă .fbx Se acceptă doar resursele încorporate; dacă modelul face referire la texturi externe sau la alte resurse, vă rugăm să păstrați căile relative și să le plasați în ZIP."
      (es) "Esta es la estructura de directorios del paquete de importación (ZIP o archivo seleccionado internamente), no el almacenamiento interno de la aplicación.

      DragonBones (.zip)
       my_dragonbones.zip
       any_folder_name/
       hero_ske.json
       hero_tex.json
       hero_tex.png
       Requisito: los nombres de archivo ske/tex json/png deben tener el mismo prefijo.

      WebP (.zip)
       my_webp.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.webp
       talking.webp
       happy.webp
       Requisito: al menos un archivo .webp.

      MP4
       Método A (archivo directo):
       avatar.mp4
       Método B (.zip):
       my_mp4.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.mp4
       talking.mp4
       happy.mp4
       Requisito: al menos un archivo .mp4.

      MMD (.zip)
       my_mmd.zip
       any_folder_name/
       character.pmx (o .pmd)
       motions/idle.vmd (opcional)
       textures/...
       Requisito: mantener las rutas relativas referenciadas por PMX/PMD.

      glTF
       Método A (archivo directo):
       avatar.glb
       Método B (glTF de múltiples archivos usando .zip):
       my_gltf.zip
       any_folder_name/
       avatar.gltf
       avatar.bin
       textures/...
       Requisito: mantener las rutas relativas referenciadas por .gltf.

      FBX
       Método A (archivo directo, solo recursos autocontenidos):
       avatar.fbx
       Método B (texturas/recursos externos usar .zip):
       my_fbx.zip
       any_folder_name/
       avatar.fbx
       textures/...
       Requisito: la carga directa de .fbx solo admite recursos incrustados; si el modelo referencia texturas externas u otros recursos, mantenga las rutas relativas y colóquelos en un ZIP."
      (ms) "Ini adalah struktur direktori untuk pakej import (ZIP atau dalam fail yang dipilih), bukan storan dalaman aplikasi.

      DragonBones (.zip)
       my_dragonbones.zip
       any_folder_name/
       hero_ske.json
       hero_tex.json
       hero_tex.png
       Keperluan: Awalan nama fail ske/tex json/png mesti sama.

      WebP (.zip)
       my_webp.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.webp
       talking.webp
       happy.webp
       Keperluan: Mesti mengandungi sekurang-kurangnya satu fail .webp.

      MP4
       Kaedah A (fail terus):
       avatar.mp4
       Kaedah B (.zip):
       my_mp4.zip
       any_folder_name/
       idle.mp4
       talking.mp4
