    resource 0x7f1316ea string/shizuku_wizard_method1_steps PUBLIC
      () "1. 点击下方"打开Shizuku"按钮
      2. 在Shizuku应用中选择"通过无线调试启动"
      3. 根据提示开启"开发者选项"和"无线调试"
      4. 允许Shizuku获取无线调试权限"
      (id) "1. Klik tombol "Buka Shizuku" di bawah
      2. Di aplikasi Shizuku, pilih "Mulai melalui Debug Nirkabel"
      3. Ikuti petunjuk untuk mengaktifkan "Opsi Pengembang" dan "Debug Nirkabel"
      4. Izinkan Shizuku mendapatkan izin debug nirkabel"
      (en) "1. Click the "Open Shizuku" button below
      2. In the Shizuku app, select "Start via Wireless Debugging"
      3. Follow the prompts to enable "Developer Options" and "Wireless Debugging"
      4. Allow Shizuku to get wireless debugging permissions"
      (ko) "1. 아래의 "Shizuku 열기" 버튼을 누릅니다
