      () "留空或 [] 表示直接把响应体当音频。支持 parse_json、pick、parse_json_string、http_get、http_request_from_object、base64_decode。"
      (id) "Kosongkan atau [] untuk langsung menggunakan isi respons sebagai audio. Mendukung parse_json, pick, parse_json_string, http_get, http_request_from_object, base64_decode."
      (en) "Leave blank or use [] to treat the response body as audio directly. Supported steps: parse_json, pick, parse_json_string, http_get, http_request_from_object, base64_decode."
      (ko) "응답 본문을 오디오로 직접 처리하려면 비워 두거나 []를 사용하세요. 지원 단계: parse_json, pick, parse_json_string, http_get, http_request_from_object, base64_decode."
      (ro) "Lăsați necompletat sau [] Indică faptul că corpul răspunsului este tratat direct ca fișier audio. Se acceptă parse_json,pick,parse_json_string,http_get,http_request_from_object,base64_decode."
      (es) "Dejar vacío o [] para tratar el cuerpo de la respuesta directamente como audio. Soporta parse_json, pick, parse_json_string, http_get, http_request_from_object, base64_decode."
      (ms) "Biarkan kosong atau [] untuk terus menggunakan badan respons sebagai audio. Menyokong parse_json, pick, parse_json_string, http_get, http_request_from_object, base64_decode."
      (pt-rBR) "Deixe em branco ou [] para tratar diretamente o corpo da resposta como áudio. Suporta parse_json, pick, parse_json_string, http_get, http_request_from_object, base64_decode."
