      () "规则会从上到下依次匹配模型，第一条启用且命中的规则生效。使用每条规则右侧的箭头调整顺序。"
      (en) "Rules are matched from top to bottom; the first enabled and matching rule takes effect. Use the arrows on the right side of each rule to adjust the order."
